tting your first project set up. In Wrenfield, projects are the main organizing unit and tasks live inside them, so adding the real work items for that project is usually what makes the rest click.\n\nIf it's useful, a teammate can be invited from Account Settings -> Members at any time, and teammates can be bulk-invited from a CSV file instead of one at a time.\n\nWould a short call this week help? I'm happy to walk through the next step with you directly.\n\nBest,\nChidi"},"actionId":"706e0912-726a-4d44-adbe-f2afa98fd71e","evidenceRefs":["e52541eb-7b90-4aa7-bb03-3473fa448428","3b6eca0c-bc14-442a-8b70-1875782aa4e1","07544ce1-66c9-486d-9cb3-1b54c77bd0c1","13c7de4f-6d35-44bf-9b23-e2a4707898df","84d7b4cb-3cb1-42c9-8ebf-65f5596d40aa","f62428f6-6759-444f-9ecc-c4ace62bcf1f"],"refs":{"email:558a8519":"13c7de4f-6d35-44bf-9b23-e2a4707898df","email:dc9058cf":"84d7b4cb-3cb1-42c9-8ebf-65f5596d40aa","calendar:9ca01317":"f62428f6-6759-444f-9ecc-c4ace62bcf1f"},"flags":[],"modelId":"claude-opus-5","promptVersion":"draft-v2@19f89f34/effort-medium","costUsd":0.01172,"trigger":[]}],"outcome":{"outcome":1,"resolvedAt":"2026-07-27T19:26:40.107Z","day":7}}
